Вслух uses unmodified model and configuration files from the following publishers.
The downloader pins the source revisions and verifies the SHA-256 of every file.

Denis and Dmitri — Rhasspy / Open Home Foundation
https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices/tree/e9c8a39444359388adaa94255becb37a5a2b8e51/ru/ru_RU
