Multi-Speaker English TTS Dataset by Evelina Bakhturina, Vitaly Lavrukhin,
Boris Ginsburg and Yang Zhang (2021) is licensed under CC BY 4.0.
https://www.openslr.org/109/
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
The training and provenance details are in the two upstream MODEL_CARD files.

